  "_comment": [
    "A real RFC 3161 token, produced offline by OpenSSL 3.0.13's TSA (`openssl ts -reply`)",
    "with a throwaway root and TSA certificate (EKU timeStamping, RSA-2048, sha256).",
    "The private keys were generated for this one response and deleted; nothing here signs anything.",
    "anchor.test.ts verifies it with gnomon's own DER code (rfc3161.ts): the embedded TSA",
    "certificate chains to the pinned root, the signed attributes cover the TSTInfo, and the",
    "imprint is sha256 of the statement's canonical JSON. It is interop evidence, not a",
    "statement about any public authority, none of which was contacted.",
    "The statement predates the scope field and is kept as it was time-stamped: the digest",
    "covers exactly these bytes."
